@startuml
title L2-051 - Publish an independent design-system reference site
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Owner / release reviewer" as actor
box "Frontend - Independent design-system site" #E0F2FE
participant "TokenReferencePage / visual review" as page
participant "ComponentStateGallery" as entity
participant "Bundled token catalog / examples" as client
end box
note over page, client : Static local content; no Loupe backend participates
actor -> page : Start workflow / review
page -> entity : Open local token/state reference [L2-051]
entity -> client : Read bundled authoritative catalog and synthetic examples
client --> entity : Names, values, roles, and interactive states
entity --> page : Keyboard-usable static reference
note over client : Application/API stopped; no personal data or runtime API calls
page --> actor : independent reference site
@enduml
